<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n87588" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προΐσχω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προέχω</span>
			, <i>hold before, hold out,</i> of boys playing at <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ποσίνδα,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
				5.10
			</span></i>:—mostly in 
				Med.
			, <i>hold out before oneself, stretch forth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.58
				</span></i>
			,<i><span class="en">
				66
			</span></i>; of nurse and child, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				6.44
			</span></i>, al.: c. gen., <i>hold before,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν ὄψεων τὰς χεῖρας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Pomp.</u>
					71
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ἱμάτιον τοῦ βιβλίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Cat. Mi.</u>
					19
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προέχω</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				30
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Mochl.</u>
				4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph. in 
				Med.
			, <i>put forward as a pretext, allege,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. πρόφασιν ὡς . .</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.165
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				6.137
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				8.3
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξυγγένειαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					1.26
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸν νόμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Alex.</u>
					14
				</span></i>
			, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>put forward as a demand,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.3
			</span></i>; <i>propose, offer,</i> ib.<i><span class="en">
				141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				164
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.87
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ξείνι᾽ ἀριστήεσσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.R.
					4.1553
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>hold out,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐλπίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Porph.
					<u>Marc.</u>
					4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>4.</b>
			<i>prosecute,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i>
		</div>
